Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.51,0:02:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Shushu. Miss Himari.\NCommander. Mr. Yuuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please let them come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.73,0:02:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of them safe and soundly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.63,0:02:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, I can't get free!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.59,0:02:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's get this party started!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.43,0:02:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel surprisingly calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.37,0:02:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After putting my team in danger,\NI needed time to cool off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.25,0:02:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart is on fire, but I\Ncan fight with a level head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.91,0:03:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without Yukki, I've got less\Nfirepower at my disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.55,0:03:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that means... No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.39,0:03:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For each and every person you've\Nmurdered, I'll slice you to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.55,0:03:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.67,0:03:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Teleportation isn't the only\Ntrick up her sleeve! Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.53,0:03:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Superhuman speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.11,0:03:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't pinpoint her position.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.69,0:03:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my sister-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.65,0:03:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go for a wider range!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.73,0:03:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.89,0:04:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I missed her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.03,0:04:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ame no mitari!
