Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.49,0:04:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's an awful lot of damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.05,0:04:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you and your friends lived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.39,0:04:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're ditching this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.25,0:04:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've already evacuated the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.43,0:04:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over consuming peaches is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.45,0:04:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've been my source of\Nenergy since the accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.49,0:04:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll
