Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.09,0:04:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beat your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.01,0:04:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially if you're a disgusting\Nbitch preying on my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.43,0:04:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big sis weapons in her arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.61,0:04:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A resilient physical form and\Na blast attack from her mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.01,0:04:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can harden and manipulate her hair\Nand gain strength by consuming peaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.69,0:04:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.81,0:04:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's pretty impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.83,0:05:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.45,0:05:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I eat peaches, it\Nheightens my senses too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.81,0:05:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's too fast for me to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.03,0:05:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you can do is flee.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.11,0:05:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'll wear you down, then take you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.23,0:05:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's a war of attrition. She wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.91,0:05:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for her, as the commander,\NI can teleport 666 times in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.25,0:05:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Comes with the territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.75,0:05:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.97,0:05:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holding out until Kyo wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.47,0:05:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment I get a chance, I'll strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.03,0:05:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hitting or grabbing me won't\Nwork when my body is slippery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.01,0:06:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,OK, then, without further delay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.07,0:06:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wa-bam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.07,0:06:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.55,0:06:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.71,0:06:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really stings, but I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.31,0:06:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but hitting me with a little\Nboulder isn't gonna do you much good.
