Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.29,0:06:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coco juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.51,0:06:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the peaches, my stamina and\Nmy regenerative abilities got enhanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.05,0:06:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Kuma's even tougher than I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.51,0:06:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not a single scratch on her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.83,0:06:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanna get away and save Yukki!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.51,0:06:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You talking about Yuki, Wakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.31,0:06:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.99,0:06:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guy you kidnapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.19,0:06:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He better be safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.89,0:06:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about him,\NI licked him all better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.35,0:06:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Licked him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.41,0:07:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our boss has a soft spot for\Nhim too. Soft spot? Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.07,0:07:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki Wakura belongs to\Nus now, so give it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.17,0:07:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their next targets are your commanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.33,0:07:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then the Onmyou Bureau.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.81,0:07:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna raise all kinds of hell\Nso the whole country knows we exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.71,0:07:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That massive Shuuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.39,0:07:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been documented by\Nthe defense force before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.03,0:07:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was spotted in a mishap\Nin Kagoshima eight years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.51,0:07:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All threats to innocent lives end here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.37,0:07:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember what we discussed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.99,0:07:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go with Formation S.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.63,0:07:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.77,0:07:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll use Formation S to wipe the floor\Nwith you pathetic pipsqueaks! Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.97,0:07:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring it on! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.47,0:08:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, does the S stand for see you later?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.81,0:08:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.63,0:08:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're really doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.83,0:08:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polarize her, Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.99,0:08:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.31,0:08:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, I can shrink myself, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.67,0:08:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The S in formation S stands for small!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.71,0:08:32.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, we grow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.63,0:08:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.93,0:08:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paradigm Shaft!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.67,0:08:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crazy, she won!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.63,0:08:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.69,0:08:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That attack won't work on...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.35,0:08:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.39,0:08:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, this isn't good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.25,0:09:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should never piss off a girl in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.79,0:09:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means you were\Ndoomed from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.87,0:09:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or Shuuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.05,0:09:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.75,0:09:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.66,0:09:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Sahara!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:10:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.42,0:10:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah! Golden hour!
