Dialogue: 2,0:10:59.22,0:11:00.34,Signs - Style 2,,0,0,0,,{=28}{\blur0.7\fs200\c&H3E0F2A&\pos(347.97,970.52)\fad(100,0)}GOLDEN HOUR
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.23,0:11:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already used my ability\Ntoo many times in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.07,0:11:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The humanoid, where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.59,0:11:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.07,0:11:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll grant you a beautiful death!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.15,0:11:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you've been protecting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.27,0:11:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's written all over your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.05,0:11:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.83,0:11:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little sister can\Nprotect her big sister too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.69,0:11:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She disappeared into the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.39,0:11:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't effective enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.29,0:11:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to lure out the enemy first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.87,0:11:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.15,0:11:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My ability's ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.69,0:11:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to stick close.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.53,0:12:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you fret, Akura.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.31,0:12:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll capitalize on their weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.57,0:12:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Victory will be ours it's too big of a\Ndistance get closer to me like this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.97,0:12:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an Azuma battle\Nformation it's the ultimate
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.03,0:12:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,defense if they launch an\Nattack while I'm moving
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.23,0:12:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's a small chance\Nthey'll overpower me before I
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.91,0:12:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,strike a pose but if I wait\Nin this position I should
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.19,0:12:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be able to react get cozy\Ncome on this isn't the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.37,0:12:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time to be shy no what's\Nthe matter the enemy could
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.67,0:12:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,decide to ignore us and we\Ncan't let her head for the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.33,0:12:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commanders, we have to move.\NOkay, look, there's a limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.79,0:12:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to how many times I can\Nuse my ability we have to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.25,0:12:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be precise I have a plan\Na secret weapon I've been
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.55,0:12:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,saving for the right moment\Nsecret weapon it'd be my
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.41,0:12:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,first time using it in\Ncombat but if it works it'll
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.33,0:12:56.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lure her out of hiding the\Nquestion is are you sure
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.85,0:12:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can actually pull\Nsomething like that off I'm not
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.49,0:13:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the same person as I was\Nback then after joining the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seventh squad and fighting\Nin the exhibition match.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.89,0:13:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've become a lot stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.55,0:13:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please trust me on this. I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.71,0:13:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're that determined, then go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.87,0:13:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never hit the enemy\Nif I'm shooting blindly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.01,0:13:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.33,0:13:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if I shoot blindly in all directions?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.25,0:13:42.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full burst fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.73,0:13:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.87,0:13:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to kill yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.23,0:14:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is suicide!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.19,0:14:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not gonna happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.77,0:14:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prime Time!
