Dialogue: 2,0:14:08.99,0:14:09.49,Signs - Style 2,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fs200\c&H3E0F2A&\pos(969.66,918.52)}PRIME TIME
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.35,0:14:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rewind for ten seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.69,0:14:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The plan worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.39,0:14:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did an excellent job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.53,0:14:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Above us, to the right,\N45 degrees! Right! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.33,0:14:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad, little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.11,0:14:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll return the favor when we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.21,0:14:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still not going back\Nhome with you, but thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.65,0:14:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have got to find Aoba.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.97,0:15:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little space between\NKyo and the Unihorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.93,0:15:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly what I've been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.01,0:15:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She tricked me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.75,0:15:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He threw up her rhythm. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.95,0:15:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you target me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.83,0:15:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know your mood's inside and out
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.93,0:15:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ame no mitori!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.05,0:15:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.67,0:16:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tenka! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.19,0:16:25.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her blast attack got faster too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.91,0:16:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops, looks like I\Nnicked you with my beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.79,0:16:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you attack me when\Nyou had the opportunity to?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.09,0:16:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'd finished you off, it would\Nhave made Yuuki really upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.75,0:16:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even I was shocked that I\Ncouldn't go through with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.13,0:17:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careless mistake. It's\Nstrange I've been having all
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.05,0:17:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sorts of new feelings I can\Ntake care of myself You don't
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.11,0:17:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,need to worry about my life\NBut I love that you took
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.45,0:17:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki's feelings into consideration\NI'm starting to like you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.53,0:17:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.03,0:17:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our bright future With my sister-in-law
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.13,0:17:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, drop the sister\Nalready! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.63,0:17:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fighting might be difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.59,0:17:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you flee now i'd be willing to\Nlook away but we have not changed
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.45,0:17:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our mind about storming the we
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.55,0:17:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will not retreat
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.59,0:17:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.27,0:18:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,killed
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.71,0:18:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Akura
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.62,0:18:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they followed us to the tunnels
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.11,0:18:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it seems as
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.57,0:18:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though your friends
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.48,0:18:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are running on empty so let me\Nask you this do you You surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.09,0:18:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.15,0:18:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.45,0:18:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here, say hello to the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.45,0:19:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was easy to find you on account\Nof that huge ruckus you made.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.19,0:19:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coco, no! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.21,0:19:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got great vitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.33,0:19:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking maybe we should bring\Nthe two of them with us, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.95,0:19:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.87,0:19:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought they were your friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.49,0:19:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't start lumping us in\Nwith these inferior mutts! Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.91,0:19:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The eight Thunder Gods stand before you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.59,0:19:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are the almighty leaders of the Shuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.25,0:19:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They control the Shuuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.17,0:19:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The eight Thunder Gods?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.15,0:19:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.23,0:19:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is our duty to destroy the human race.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.99,0:19:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're divine beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.23,0:19:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feel free to worship us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.29,0:19:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jouryuu?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.05,0:20:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you are, I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.79,0:20:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A big sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.21,0:20:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.75,0:20:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kitomaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.79,0:20:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.65,0:20:36.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.15,0:20:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Shuki has been bitten\Nby one of my snakes,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.99,0:20:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thereby restoring to its\Noriginal murderous nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.31,0:20:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, no need for you to hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.99,0:20:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do all the damage you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.21,0:21:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your hands off my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.79,0:21:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.70,0:21:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.62,0:21:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will force\Nthem to bow down! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.65,0:21:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare to die!
